    "sha256": "fb27e5839aa11f0e5b9d33756965291fad5d6909ab928ea1f796f4a1a6877894",
    "note": "R1-D8 and R1-D19: x64/soft_oal.dll holds the commit b2c48f771 of the tag 1.25.2, so this archive is its source. The archive of 2026-10-18 has 1,407,972 bytes. Its 461 files have the git blob hashes of the tree of the tag, and its pax comment is the commit b2c48f7718ef3fcf67921a8b6534c4914e328970. tools/release.ps1 downloads the archive and refuses it when its SHA-256 is not this value."
  },
